WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.542 --> 00:00:06.333
We interrupt this broadcast
for an emergency alert.

00:00:06.667 --> 00:00:09.125
The Department of Defense
is confirming reports

00:00:09.208 --> 00:00:12.167
of an unknown object
entering Earth's atmosphere.

00:00:15.125 --> 00:00:16.917
An alien artifact
landed on Earth.

00:00:18.958 --> 00:00:20.042
We need to know why.

00:00:20.458 --> 00:00:22.125
And they want me
to lead the mission.

00:00:23.667 --> 00:00:26.250
-It should be six months.
-If all goes as planned.

00:00:27.208 --> 00:00:30.042
I am coming back,
I promise you.

00:00:31.125 --> 00:00:32.667
This is the most
important mission

00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:34.042
in the history of humankind.

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:36.083
It's time.

00:00:41.125 --> 00:00:42.167
Here we go.

00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:48.125
We are on our way
to a planet full of aliens.

00:00:49.750 --> 00:00:50.667
I found something.

00:00:51.417 --> 00:00:53.333
How many of these
you think are out there?

00:00:55.792 --> 00:00:58.583
Our first contact with
an alien civilization is a risk!

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:01.917
People will die!

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:09.000
We are all here
for the same reason:

00:01:09.958 --> 00:01:13.292
to protect the lives
of the people back on Earth.

00:01:14.667 --> 00:01:15.875
Wait, what's that?

00:01:16.292 --> 00:01:17.500
Help me!

00:01:21.583 --> 00:01:22.667
I am gonna get home.

00:01:24.708 --> 00:01:25.750
Don't let go!

00:01:26.917 --> 00:01:28.958
What's happened here
is gonna happen on Earth.

00:01:29.042 --> 00:01:30.292
Oh God, no.

00:01:31.333 --> 00:01:32.625
I have to save the crew.

00:01:34.083 --> 00:01:35.000
Save Earth.

00:01:35.875 --> 00:01:37.250
What if by doing this,

00:01:37.333 --> 00:01:38.958
we launch
into an interstellar war?

00:01:42.417 --> 00:01:43.792
We don't have a choice.

